"anima web start --foreground # standalone Web static server (default :2659; production: web.enabled + service stack)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:42
msgid ""
"`anima.service` is a **single-unit stack**: Hub (`:2658`, REST + SAP + "
"bundled `/web` when `web.enabled`) + optional Tunnel (cloudflared) managed "
"by one foreground supervisor. Legacy `anima-tunnel.service` is disabled on "
"next `service start`."
msgstr ""
"`anima.service` 是**单单元栈**：Hub（`:2658`）+ 可选 Web（`:2659`）+ 可选 "
"Tunnel（cloudflared），由同一前台 supervisor 管理。下次 `service start` 时会"
"禁用旧版 `anima-tunnel.service`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:44
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "When `web.enabled: true`, the stack serves browser Web UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/*` from Hub (no separate API proxy). Clients store Hub URL and **Service API Token** (`fa_at_...`) in **Hub settings**. For standalone static hosting without the Hub process, use `anima web start --foreground` (default `:2659`).\n"
msgid "When `web.enabled: true`, the stack serves browser Web UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/*` from Hub (no separate API proxy). Clients store Hub URL and **Service API Token** (`fa_at_...`) in **Hub settings**. For standalone static hosting without the Hub process, use `anima web start --foreground` (default `:2660`). Optional Hub native TLS listens on **`https://<host>:2659`** when `http.tls.enabled: true` (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)).\n"
msgstr "启用 `web.enabled: true` 时，栈由 Hub 在 `http://<host>:2658/web/*` 提供浏览器 Web UI（无独立 API 代理）。客户端在 **Hub 设置** 中保存 Hub URL 与**服务 API 令牌**（`fa_at_...`）。若无需 Hub 进程单独托管静态资源，使用 `anima web start --foreground`（默认 `:2659`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:46
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**Startup order:** Hub must pass `GET /api/health` (`status: ok`) before Tunnel sidecars start (`serve()` `onReady` → stack supervisor). SAP disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/sap-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgid "**Startup order:** Hub must pass `GET /hub/rpc/v1/health/probe` (`status: ok`) before Tunnel sidecars start (`serve()` `onReady` → stack supervisor). SAP disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/sap-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgstr "**启动顺序：** Hub 须先通过 `GET /api/health`（`status: ok`），再启动 Web/Tunnel 边车（`serve()` `onReady` → 栈 supervisor）。SAP 断线由 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 传输层自动重试（指数退避）。\n"

